{
  "name": "n8n Security Advisory Triage",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ N8N SECURITY ADVISORY TRIAGE\n**What it does:** Every morning the workflow pulls the latest n8n security advisories from the GitHub Advisory Database → dedupes against your Google Sheet → an AI agent checks whether YOUR n8n version falls in the vulnerable range → sends urgent Telegram alerts for high/critical CVEs affecting you → posts a daily digest.\n\n**Context:** In October 2026 GitHub published the largest single batch of n8n security advisories to date — 10 High + 4 Medium GHSA items, fixed in n8n 2.41.4 / 2.42.1. Self-hosters who miss these stay exposed. This workflow makes sure you know within hours whether you're affected.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credential (n8n Credentials → Google Sheets OAuth2)\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot; @userinfobot for your chat ID)\n- Your n8n version (in n8n: Settings → About)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `ASSESSED` → `NOTIFIED_URGENT`",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 4840,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "805aed0d-1f7d-4122-aa8b-663dae580343",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Daily trigger + fetch GitHub advisories\nDaily 7 AM schedule trigger → pull the latest n8n advisories from the GitHub Advisory Database (npm ecosystem). No auth needed.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1518b781-b14c-4a2f-9e7f-efbb386befce",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Dedupe vs seen IDs + log NEW\nCompare fetched advisories against the GHSA IDs already in your sheet → keep only fresh ones → append rows with status `NEW`. If nothing is new, you get a short all-clear message.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6f156b9e-e991-428a-80e7-06d30d5d8fb8",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — AI impact assessment vs YOUR version\nAI Agent compares each advisory's vulnerable version range against your n8n version with a Structured Output Parser (severity, is_my_version_affected, patch_action) → sheet flips to `ASSESSED`.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 960,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5a10af8b-c873-415d-b0e5-06f6fdd371aa",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — Urgent alerts + daily digest\nAdvisories that affect your version AND are high/critical severity → instant 🚨 Telegram alert, sheet flips to `NOTIFIED_URGENT`. Everything merges into one daily digest on Telegram.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1720,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "50298826-c5e9-4a9e-9ebe-a3d22aa6ee07",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
